<!--
  Linexa — Persian (فارسی) locale strings.

  This is a STARTER translation covering the most common UI strings: app name,
  common actions/states, the most-frequent dialogs, navigation labels, and
  home-screen strings. Strings not yet translated fall back to English
  (the default `values/strings.xml`). To complete the translation, copy any
  missing keys from `values/strings.xml` and translate their text.

  RTL: Android automatically applies RTL layout for `fa`-locale devices
  (Manifest android:supportsRtl="true"). No code changes required.

  Translation conventions:
    - "workspace" → «فضای کار» (lit. "work space")
    - "terminal" → «ترمینال» (transliteration, the standard technical term)
    - "rootfs" → «rootfs» (kept as-is; a technical identifier per the §
      rule about not localizing technical identifiers)
    - "PRoot" → «PRoot» (kept as-is)
    - "Linexa" → «Linexa» (kept as-is, brand name)
-->
